sion.",{"children":"Instead of calling yourself passionate, resilient or a leader, describe the choice you made, the difficulty you handled and the result. Let the reader reach the conclusion."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Keep the scholarship central",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep the scholarship central"}],[["$","p","Show that you understand what the funder values. Connect your examples to that purpose without repeating slogans from the website.",{"children":"Show that you understand what the funder values. Connect your examples to that purpose without repeating slogans from the website."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Edit for clarity",{"id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Edit for clarity"}],[["$","p","Remove biography that does not support the application, generic praise and sentences that could be sent to another programme unchanged. Check the exact word or character limit before formatting.",{"children":"Remove biography that does not support the application, generic praise and sentences that could be sent to another programme unchanged. Check the exact word or character limit before formatting."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Research before drafting",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Research before drafting"}],[["$","p","Write down the scholarship's purpose, selection criteria, eligible course and expected future contribution. Match each point to evidence from your record before deciding what belongs in the letter.",{"children":"Write down the scholarship's purpose, selection criteria, eligible course and expected future contribution. Match each point to evidence from your record before deciding what belongs in the letter."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","A paragraph planning method",{"id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A paragraph planning method"}],["$L16"],"$L17"]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a"]]}],null,"$L1b"]}],"$L1c"]}]
