16:["$","p","For each paragraph, write one claim, one specific example and one sentence explaining why the example matters to this opportunity. This prevents a list of achievements from replacing the argument.",{"children":"For each paragraph, write one claim, one specific example and one sentence explaining why the example matters to this opportunity. This prevents a list of achievements from replacing the argument."}]
